# Designyar product

- Design Thinking → **one-job micro-forms** (wizard), not multi-tool dashboards
- Every form: one **کمک هوش مصنوعی** action (improve+complete together) + Accept / Reject (no silent overwrite)
- AI text values must be **Persian** unless a specific technical term needs English
- Persian RTL UI; soft guidance only — **no SoftGate / PhaseShell locks**
- **Keep:** `App.vue`, `AppLayout.vue`, `configProvider.store.ts`
- **Out of scope:** native mobile, backend/sync API, WebLLM, Next.js chat API, server DevOps beyond static SPA
- Build **phase / micro-phase** then ask before continuing — see `.cursor/skills/ux-flow/SKILL.md`
